.* BACKUP: the task menu for the backup tasks.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='BACKUP'.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPBCKSTS PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=INZTAP PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.F1=Help
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION='CMD CALL QCMD'.F9=Command line
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=BACKUP HELP=HLPBACKUP KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Backup Tasks
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.To select one of the following, type its number below and press Enter:
:MENUI HELP='BACKUP/OPT1' OPTION=1 ACTION='MENU RUNBCKUP'.Run backup
:MENUI HELP=DSPBCKSTS OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD DSPBCKSTS'.Display backup status
:MENUI HELP='BACKUP/OPT10' OPTION=10 ACTION='MENU SETUPBCKUP'.Set up backup
:MENUI HELP=INZTAP OPTION=20 ACTION='CMD ?INZTAP'.Initialize a tape
:MENUI HELP=INZTAP OPTION=21 ACTION='CMD ?INZTAP'.Initialize a tape set
:EMENU.
:BOTINST.Type a menu option below
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPBACKUP.Backup Tasks - Help
:P.Saving the system on a schedule: run a backup now, see how the last one
went, change what is saved, and prepare the tapes.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter. F9 opens a command line, F3
leaves the menu and F12 returns to the one before it.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for where the cursor is.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F9=Command line
:PD.Shows a command line to run a command from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='BACKUP/OPT1'.Run backup
:P.Option 1. Shows menu RUNBCKUP&colon. Run backup.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='BACKUP/OPT10'.Set up backup
:P.Option 10. Shows menu SETUPBCKUP&colon. Set up backup.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
